"""Hotspot Manager - lightweight GTK front-end for create_ap (main Wi-Fi + hotspot).

Command line:
  hotspot-manager                 open the window
  hotspot-manager --hidden        start in the tray (used at login)
  hotspot-manager --qr            show the QR code window
  hotspot-manager --on | --off | --toggle | --restart [--no-wait]
  hotspot-manager --status [--json]
"""
